Verify the exception issuer's authority and the exact person, night, category, amount, purpose and period it covers. An exception for one night cannot authorize an entire trip. Separate approval of travel from approval of an excess charge. Return the signed exception basis or the missing authority question; persuasive circumstances without authorization remain reviewable, not approved.
